# What happened to ozone-destroying gases after the world agreed to ban them?
subtitle: "Draw what happened to ozone-destroying gases after 1989, then see the 99 % fall, why it worked, and how long the sky still needs to heal."
tags: ["earth","chemistry","history"]
format: quiz
thumb: "band \"The ban nobody remembers\" note \"Draw the rest\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Iapetus | a clear, curious quiz host; plain and friendly","take":"lines"}

## What happened to ozone-destroying gases after the world agreed to ban them?
text: {"font_size":34}
use: line_chart
with:
    x:
      - 1986
      - 1989
      - 1992
      - 1995
      - 1998
      - 2001
      - 2004
      - 2007
      - 2010
      - 2013
      - 2016
      - 2019
